config USB_CC_WUSB3801X
	bool "WUSB3801X Type-C configuration-channel controller"
	depends on I2C=y && MTK_ACCDET
	default n
	---help---
	  WillSemi WUSB3801X CC-logic controller on the k50sv1_64_bsp USB-C
	  port.  It detects the attached partner, advertises host current,
	  and on an audio accessory routes the analog switch and hands the
	  headset to ACCDET.  Host mode itself is owned by the MediaTek USB
	  controller's ID-pin path.
